<https://www.insperity.com/resource/change-log/ChangeRecord/2026-10-19T184540Z-core-ontology> a prov:Activity , dct:ProvenanceStatement ;
  rdfs:label "Core domain ontology rebuilt to the asset and Jobs model (Baseline Core v1.0), 2026-10-19T18:45:40Z"@en ;
  dct:description "The core domain ontology was rebuilt from ontology-core.source.ttl with build_core.py: 36 classes with hyphen-joined IRIs, all under BFO 2020; asset as the genus with product, service, offering and platform as assets assembled from other assets; lifecycles for every asset; the Jobs model (job, job step, desired outcome, delivered outcome); relations has component, lifecycle of, delivery of, delivers (property chain), addresses and supports; polymorphic classes kept only where they differ in BFO. Shapes rebuilt (13). core:formalizedBy re-pointed to the new class IRIs on the taxonomy top concepts (8 left for a modeling decision). RO extract 0.2.0 adds causally upstream of. Changed outside the KE Workbench; recorded retrospectively on 2026-10-19T19:06:10Z."@en ;
  dct:creator "Jeffrey Wallk" ;
  dct:contributor "Claude (AI assistant), at the direction of Jeffrey Wallk" ;
